00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:18,800
D2 Read Amy's diary entry about a DIY activity Tuesday the 2nd of November cloudy Last Saturday, I went to Millie's home.

2
00:00:18,800 --> 00:01:07,850
We made a cute little doll from an old glove First we chose a clean glove with bright colors and a fun pattern Next we made the doll's legs from the two longest fingers of the glove and its arms from two of the other fingers Then we used the main part of the glove as the head and the body for the eyes We glued two buttons Finally we added some colorful string to the head and that was the doll's hair After we finished we gave the doll to Millie's neighbor a little girl She loved it.

3
00:01:07,850 --> 00:01:10,760
We felt very proud and happy
